{
  "_doc": [
    "PRODUCT / USAGE dashboard (monitoring plan §2.A, 受众: 产品 / 非技术).",
    "TEMPLATE — placeholders ${REGION} and ${NAMESPACE} are rendered by",
    "scripts/render_dashboard.py before put-dashboard. Do NOT hand-edit the rendered output;",
    "edit THIS template and re-render (源在 git, 看板是生成物 — plan 原则1).",
    "",
    "HARD CONSTRAINT (plan 阶段2): every widget is type:metric (reads CloudWatch metrics extracted",
    "by the metric-filters). NO type:log Logs-Insights widgets — those re-scan raw logs on every",
    "open, billed by bytes + consume the regional concurrency cap (plan 原则2 / 风险表).",
    "",
    "Dimensioned metrics (FeedbackVoted by vote, FeedbackReason by reasonCode) use SEARCH() so the",
    "widget auto-discovers dimension values without hardcoding them. DAU is B-class: it reads a",
    "PRE-AGGREGATED custom metric (${NAMESPACE} DAU) produced by the scheduled Lambda (live:",
    "source-truth-dau-preaggregate, daily 16:30 UTC = 00:30 东八区, counts the prior 东八区 day's",
    "distinct hashUserId). The widget fills once a full day has accrued; a fresh deploy shows 0",
    "until then, by design (never a real-time log-dedup widget)."
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 2,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "# source-truth · 用量看板（产品）\n机器人的使用量与回答质量。数据来自网关日志（非实时扫描）。回答延迟与系统健康看 **健康看板**。"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "提问量 / 追问量（每日）",
        "region": "${REGION}",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stacked": false,
        "period": 86400,
        "stat": "Sum",
        "metrics": [
          [
            "${NAMESPACE}",
            "QuestionsReceived",
            {
              "label": "提问数",
              "color": "#1f77b4"
            }
          ],
          [
            "${NAMESPACE}",
            "FollowupQuestions",
            {
              "label": "其中追问数",
              "color": "#aec7e8"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 2,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "追问占比（追问 / 总提问）",
        "region": "${REGION}",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "period": 86400,
        "yAxis": {
          "left": {
            "min": 0,
            "max": 1,
            "label": "占比",
            "showUnits": false
          }
        },
        "metrics": [
          [
            "${NAMESPACE}",
            "FollowupQuestions",
            {
              "id": "fu",
              "visible": false,
              "stat": "Sum",
              "period": 86400
            }
          ],
          [
            "${NAMESPACE}",
            "QuestionsReceived",
            {
              "id": "q",
              "visible": false,
              "stat": "Sum",
              "period": 86400
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "expression": "fu / q",
              "label": "追问占比",
              "id": "ratio"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 8,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "点赞率（赞 / (赞+踩)）与反馈覆盖率（投票数 / 完成数）",
        "region": "${REGION}",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "period": 86400,
        "yAxis": {
          "left": {
            "min": 0,
            "max": 1,
            "label": "占比",
            "showUnits": false
          }
        },
        "metrics": [
          [
            {
              "expression": "up / (up + down)",
              "label": "点赞率",
              "id": "likeRate",
              "color": "#2ca02c"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "expression": "(up + down) / completed",
              "label": "反馈覆盖率",
              "id": "coverage",
              "color": "#ff7f0e"
            }
          ],
          [
            "${NAMESPACE}",
            "FeedbackVoted",
            "vote",
            "up",
            {
              "id": "up",
              "visible": false,
              "stat": "Sum"
            }
          ],
          [
            "${NAMESPACE}",
            "FeedbackVoted",
            "vote",
            "down",
            {
              "id": "down",
              "visible": false,
              "stat": "Sum"
            }
          ],
          [
            "${NAMESPACE}",
            "AnswerCompleted",
            {
              "id": "completed",
              "visible": false,
              "stat": "Sum"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 8,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "负反馈原因分布",
        "region": "${REGION}",
        "view": "pie",
        "period": 2592000,
        "stat": "Sum",
        "metrics": [
          [
            {
              "expression": "SEARCH('{${NAMESPACE},reasonCode} MetricName=\"FeedbackReason\"', 'Sum', 2592000)",
              "label": "",
              "id": "reasons"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 14,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "代码检索充分度（每答平均引用代码处数）",
        "region": "${REGION}",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "period": 86400,
        "stat": "Average",
        "metrics": [
          [
            "${NAMESPACE}",
            "EvidenceCitations",
            {
              "label": "平均证据数/答",
              "color": "#9467bd"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 14,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "日活用户（DAU · 每日预聚合，东八区自然日去重）",
        "region": "${REGION}",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "period": 86400,
        "stat": "Maximum",
        "metrics": [
          [
            "${NAMESPACE}",
            "DAU",
            {
              "label": "日活用户数",
              "color": "#17becf"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 8,
      "height": 5,
      "properties": {
        "title": "今日提问量",
        "region": "${REGION}",
        "view": "singleValue",
        "period": 86400,
        "stat": "Sum",
        "sparkline": true,
        "metrics": [
          [
            "${NAMESPACE}",
            "QuestionsReceived",
            {
              "label": "提问数"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 8,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 8,
      "height": 5,
      "properties": {
        "title": "答案成功率（成功 / 提问）",
        "region": "${REGION}",
        "view": "singleValue",
        "period": 86400,
        "sparkline": true,
        "yAxis": {
          "left": {
            "min": 0,
            "max": 1,
            "showUnits": false
          }
        },
        "metrics": [
          [
            "${NAMESPACE}",
            "AnswerCompleted",
            {
              "id": "ok",
              "visible": false,
              "stat": "Sum"
            }
          ],
          [
            "${NAMESPACE}",
            "QuestionsReceived",
            {
              "id": "qs",
              "visible": false,
              "stat": "Sum"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "expression": "ok / qs",
              "label": "成功率",
              "id": "sr"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 8,
      "height": 5,
      "properties": {
        "title": "今日点赞率",
        "region": "${REGION}",
        "view": "singleValue",
        "period": 86400,
        "sparkline": true,
        "yAxis": {
          "left": {
            "min": 0,
            "max": 1,
            "showUnits": false
          }
        },
        "metrics": [
          [
            "${NAMESPACE}",
            "FeedbackVoted",
            "vote",
            "up",
            {
              "id": "u",
              "visible": false,
              "stat": "Sum"
            }
          ],
          [
            "${NAMESPACE}",
            "FeedbackVoted",
            "vote",
            "down",
            {
              "id": "d",
              "visible": false,
              "stat": "Sum"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "expression": "u / (u + d)",
              "label": "点赞率",
              "id": "lr"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 25,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "回答产出趋势（成功 / 失败 / 用户中止，每日）",
        "region": "${REGION}",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stacked": true,
        "period": 86400,
        "stat": "Sum",
        "metrics": [
          [
            "${NAMESPACE}",
            "AnswerCompleted",
            {
              "label": "成功",
              "color": "#2ca02c"
            }
          ],
          [
            "${NAMESPACE}",
            "AnswerFailedTotal",
            {
              "label": "失败",
              "color": "#d62728"
            }
          ],
          [
            "${NAMESPACE}",
            "AnswerAborted",
            {
              "label": "中止（用户停止）",
              "color": "#7f7f7f"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 25,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "澄清触发率（出澄清按钮 / 提问）",
        "region": "${REGION}",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "period": 86400,
        "yAxis": {
          "left": {
            "min": 0,
            "max": 1,
            "label": "占比",
            "showUnits": false
          }
        },
        "metrics": [
          [
            "${NAMESPACE}",
            "ClarifyShown",
            {
              "id": "cl",
              "visible": false,
              "stat": "Sum"
            }
          ],
          [
            "${NAMESPACE}",
            "QuestionsReceived",
            {
              "id": "qc",
              "visible": false,
              "stat": "Sum"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "expression": "cl / qc",
              "label": "澄清率",
              "id": "clr",
              "color": "#bcbd22"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0, "y": 31, "width": 24, "height": 2,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "## 使用规律\n按小时看提问量分布，找出使用高峰时段（决定暖机 / 扩容时机）；追问深度反映一次提问通常要追几轮才问清。"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0, "y": 33, "width": 12, "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "每小时提问量（找使用高峰时段）",
        "region": "${REGION}",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stacked": false,
        "period": 3600,
        "stat": "Sum",
        "yAxis": {"left": {"label": "次/小时", "showUnits": false, "min": 0}},
        "metrics": [
          ["${NAMESPACE}", "QuestionsReceived", {"label": "提问量", "color": "#1f77b4"}]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 12, "y": 33, "width": 12, "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "首次提问 vs 追问（每日；追问占比高=话题需多轮才问清）",
        "region": "${REGION}",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stacked": true,
        "period": 86400,
        "stat": "Sum",
        "yAxis": {"left": {"label": "次", "showUnits": false, "min": 0}},
        "metrics": [
          ["${NAMESPACE}", "QuestionsReceived", {"id": "tot", "visible": false}],
          ["${NAMESPACE}", "FollowupQuestions", {"label": "追问", "color": "#ff7f0e"}],
          [{"expression": "tot - FILL(fu, 0)", "label": "首次提问", "id": "first", "color": "#2ca02c"}],
          ["${NAMESPACE}", "FollowupQuestions", {"id": "fu", "visible": false}]
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
